bürindid.","One long run. Highest score wins.":"Üks pikk jooks. Suurim punktisumma võidab.","Mastery":"Meisterlikkus","Cleared":"Läbitud","Best {score}":"Parim {score}","Each lesson unlocks by doing, not reading.":"Iga õppetund avaneb tegemise, mitte lugemise kaudu.","Done":"Valmis","Round rules":"Ringireeglid","1 player":"1 mängija","How to steer":"Kuidas juhtida","First time?":"Esimest korda?","Try the Learn lessons":"Proovige õppetunde","Options":"Valikud","Start round":"Alusta vooru","Score breakdown":"Skoori jaotus","Total":"Kokku","Achievements unlocked":"Saavutused avatud","Comparison":"Võrdlus","Retry":"Proovi uuesti","Watch replay":"Vaata kordust","Leave":"Lahku","How to play":"Kuidas mängida","Turn with {up}, {left}, {down}, {right}, swipe, the on-screen pad, or tap a tile. The serpent always moves forward.":"Pöörake funktsioonidega {up}, {left}, {down}, {right}, pühkige ekraanil kuvatavat padjakest või puudutage paani. Madu liigub alati edasi.","Berries grow your serpent and add score. Golden berries are worth far more and grow two segments.":"Marjad kasvatavad su madu ja lisavad skoori. Kuldsed marjad on palju väärtuslikumad ja kasvatavad kaks segmenti.","Hazards":"Ohud","Walls, rocks, hedges, and your own body end the round. Plan ahead — you cannot reverse.":"Seinad, kivid, hekid ja teie enda keha lõpetavad ringi. Planeerige ette – te ei saa tagasi pöörata.","Small rivals":"Väikesed rivaalid","Golden rivals are prey: catch any part of one with your head to defeat it for a big bonus.":"Kuldsed rivaalid on saagiks: püüdke selle mis tahes osa peaga, et see suure boonuse saamiseks alistada.","Big rivals":"Suured vastased","Dark plated rivals hunt you. Any contact is fatal. They telegraph by shape: spikes mean danger.":"Tumedad rivaalid jahivad teid. Igasugune kontakt on surmav. Nad telegrafeerivad kuju järgi: naelu tähendavad ohtu.","Each round lists its goals. Complete all of them to win; finishing under par earns bonus points.":"Iga voor loetleb oma eesmärgid. Võitmiseks täitke need kõik; kui lõpetate alla nominaalväärtuse, teenite boonuspunkte.","Undo & hints":"Võta tagasi ja vihjed","Undo ({undo}) and hints ({hint}) are available in Practice. Pause with {pause}.":"Tagasivõtmine ({undo}) ja vihjed ({hint}) on praktikas saadaval. Peatage {pause}-ga.","Scoring":"Punktide arvestus","Score = food + growth + rival defeats + survival + objectives. Ties break on completion, then fewer invalid moves, then faster time.":"Skoor = toit + kasv + rivaali lüüasaamine + ellujäämine + eesmärgid. Lõpetamisel sidemed katkevad, siis vähem kehtetuid käike, siis kiirem aeg.","Replay tutorials":"Korda õpetusi","← Back":"← Tagasi","Achievements":"Saavutused","Cosmetics":"Kosmeetika","Cosmetics change looks only — never hitboxes, timing, or power.":"Kosmeetika muudab ainult välimust — mitte kunagi tabamuskaste, ajastust ega võimu.","{name} ({cost} mastery)":"{name} ({cost} meisterlikkus)","Open journey map":"Ava reisikaart","Display name":"Kuvatav nimi","Save":"Salvesta","Casual board — offline scores are not server-validated.":"Tavaline laud — võrguühenduseta tulemusi ei valideerita serveris.","No scores yet. Be the first!":"Pole veel skoore. Ole esimene!","seed {seed}":"seeme {seed}","golden berry at column {x}, row {y}":"kuldne mari veerus {x}, reas {y}","berry at column {x}, row {y}":"marja veerus {x}, reas {y}","hunter at column {x}, row {y}":"jahimees veerus {x}, reas {y}","Arena {w} by {h}. Serpent length {len}, heading {dir}, head at column {x}, row {y}.":"Areen {w} × {h}. Madu pikkus {len}, suund {dir}, pea veerus {x}, reas {y}.","Food: {list}.":"Toit: {list}.","none":"puudub","Threats: {list}":"Ohud: {list}","No hunters.":"Jahimehi pole.","Ranked":"Reitinguga","Unranked":"Paremusjärjestuseta","Morning Meadow":"Hommikune mädalaud","Sunset Orchard":"Loodeaed","Moonlit Pond":"Kuuvalge tiik","Autumn Hollow":"Sügisküngas","Coral Dunes":"Korallidüned","First Slither":"Esimene libisemine","Berry Trail":"Marjarada","Long Way Round":"Pikk ring","Mastery: The Open Field":"Meisterlikkus: avatud väli","Growing Pains":"Kasvuvalud","Coiled Garden":"Kõver aed","Mastery: Knotwork":"Meisterlikkus: Knotwork","First Hunt":"Esimene jaht","Two in the Grass":"Kaks rohus","Hunter's Picnic":"Jahimehe piknik","Mastery: Ambush Lanes":"Meisterlikkus: Ambush Lanes","Something Bigger":"Midagi suuremat","Keep Your Distance":"Hoidke oma distantsi","Hunted Hunter":"Jahitud jahimees","Mastery: Moonlit Chase":"Meisterlikkus: Kuuvalgel tagaajamine","Golden Hour":"Kuldne tund","Risk and Reward":"Risk ja tulu","Mastery: High Roller":"Meisterlikkus: High Roller","Quickened Pace":"Kiirenenud tempo","Swift Current":"Kiire hoovus","Mastery: Blink":"Meisterlikkus: Blink","Hedge Maze":"Hekilabürint","Ring Around":"Ring ümber","Mastery: The Warrens":"Meisterlikkus: Warrenid","Long Afternoon":"Pikk pärastlõuna","Stalemate":"Patiseis","Mastery: Marathon":"Meisterlikkus: maraton","Crossfire":"Risttuli","Tight Quarters":"Tihedad veerandid","Mastery: Crucible":"Meisterlikkus: tiigel","Grand Meadow":"Suur niit","Grand Orchard":"Suur viljapuuaed","Grand Hollow":"Suur org","Grand Pond":"Suur tiik","Grand Dunes":"Suured luited","Mastery: The Grand Tour":"Meisterlikkus: suur ringreis","Needle's Eye":"Nõelasilm","Feeding Frenzy":"Söötmispidustus","Apex Garden":"Tippaed","Serpent's Due":"Madu tasu","The Long Coil":"Long Coil","Mastery: Serpent Quest":"Meisterlikkus: Serpent Quest","Lesson 1: Steering":"1. õppetund: Juhtimine","Steer the serpent. Use arrow keys, WASD, swipe, or tap a tile to choose a direction.":"Juhtida madu. Suuna valimiseks kasutage nooleklahve, WASD-d, pühkige või puudutage paani.","Lesson 2: Eating & Growing":"2. õppetund: söömine ja kasvatamine","Eat 3 berries. Every berry makes you longer and adds to your score.":"Söö 3 marja. Iga mari muudab teid pikemaks ja lisab teie skoori.","Lesson 3: Danger":"3. õppetund: oht","Walls, stones, and your own body are lethal. Survive 40 ticks while growing to length 6.":"Seinad, kivid ja teie enda keha on surmavad. Ellu 40 puuki, kasvades 6 pikkuseks.","Lesson 4: Hunting Rivals":"4. õppetund: Rivaalide jaht","Small golden rivals are prey. Catch one with your head to defeat it.":"Väikesed kuldsed rivaalid on saagiks. Püüdke üks peaga, et see lüüa.","Lesson 5: Bigger Threats":"5. õppetund: Suuremad ohud","Large dark rivals hunt YOU. Any touch is fatal. Survive 60 ticks.":"Suured tumedad rivaalid jahivad SIND. Iga puudutus on saatuslik. Ellu 60 puuki.","Counted Steps":"Loendatud sammud","Finish 8 berries within 90 moves.":"Lõpetage 8 marja 90 liigutusega.","Tailwind":"Tagatuul","High speed: eat 10 berries.":"Suur kiirus: söö 10 marja.","Hedgemaze":"Hedgemaze","A dense garden cross. Reach length 12.":"Tihe aiarist. Jõua pikkuseni 12.","Rival Rush":"Rivaal Rush","Defeat 4 small rivals while a big one prowls.":"Alista 4 väikest rivaali, samal ajal kui suur luusib.","Golden Only":"Ainult kuldne","Score 400 with golden berries everywhere.":"Hind 400 kuldsete marjadega kõikjal.","The Gauntlet":"Katsumus","Survive 300 ticks with two hunters.":"Ellu kahe jahimehega 300 puuki.","Relaxed":"Rahulik","Steady":"Steady","Brisk":"Vigane","Fierce":"Äge","The round is already over.":"Ring on juba läbi.","Unknown direction.":"Tundmatu suund.","The serpent cannot reverse into itself.":"Madu ei saa endasse ümber pöörata.","Command is not an object.":"Käsk ei ole objekt.","Unknown command type.":"Tundmatu käsutüüp.","Low thud — serpent down":"Madal mürts – madu maha","Guest Gardener":"Külalisaednik","Bramble":"Kibuvits","Moss":"Moss","Thistle":"Ohakas","{name} (spirit)":"{name} (vaim)","That move is not legal.":"See käik pole lubatud.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Edenemine taastatud sinu StarHermiti pilvesalvestusest.","Close panel":"Sule paneel","Close":"Sulge","Angled garden view":"Nurga all aianägemus","Top-down view":"Ülevalt alla vaade","Sound, graphics, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options."